                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="e12" edge="1" parent="1" source="vpc" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#DD344C;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#DD344C;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.44;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" target="iam" value="IAM Roles, segredos e chaves KMS">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="rules" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;spacing=8;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Regras de segurança (Security Groups, IAM e políticas de serviço)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); background: rgb(35, 47, 62); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Regra&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); background: rgb(35, 47, 62); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Origem&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); background: rgb(35, 47, 62); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Destino&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); background: rgb(35, 47, 62); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Protocolo / Porta&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); background: rgb(35, 47, 62); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Justificativa&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;app-prod-alb-sg — entrada&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Internet (0.0.0.0/0)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;ALB&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;TCP 443 / HTTPS&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Único ponto de entrada público; WAF associado por Web ACL; certificado ACM.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;app-prod-api-sg — entrada&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;app-prod-alb-sg&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;EC2 API A/B&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;TCP 3000&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;API recebe somente do ALB; sem IP público nas instâncias.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;app-prod-api-sg — administração&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;app-prod-vpn-sg (CIDR administrativo autorizado)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;EC2 API A/B&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;SSM via endpoints; SSH TCP 22 somente se indispensável&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Preferir Session Manager; se SSH for usado, restringir origem e usuários.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;app-prod-api-sg — saída para banco&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;app-prod-api-sg&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;app-prod-db-sg / RDS&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;TCP 3306&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Somente conexão necessária da API ao banco.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;app-prod-db-sg — entrada&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;app-prod-api-sg&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;RDS MySQL&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;TCP 3306&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Banco em sub-redes privadas; sem acesso público. Acesso VPN ao DB apenas se justificado e autorizado.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;app-prod-api-sg — saída para endpoints&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;app-prod-api-sg&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;app-prod-vpce-sg / Interface Endpoints&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;TCP 443 / HTTPS&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Secrets Manager, CloudWatch Logs e KMS apenas quando necessários.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;S3 — acesso privado&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;IAM Role da API + VPC Endpoint conforme política&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Bucket de uploads&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;HTTPS 443&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Block Public Access; bucket policy restringe principals e, quando adequado, vpce; permissões S3 limitadas ao bucket/prefixo necessário.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;app-prod-vpce-sg — entrada&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;app-prod-api-sg&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Interface Endpoints&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;TCP 443&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Somente as instâncias da API autorizadas.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;app-prod-vpn-sg — entrada&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Administradores autorizados&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Client VPN Endpoint&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;TCP/UDP 443 conforme configuração&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Autenticação forte/MFA, rotas e regras de autorização explícitas.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Saída das EC2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;API EC2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;RDS, endpoints e destinos estritamente necessários&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;TCP 3306 / TCP 443; demais portas somente justificadas&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(153, 153, 153); padding: 4px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Revisar e restringir egress; evitar saída ampla por padrão quando possível.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Acesso administrativo:&lt;/b&gt; Client VPN com MFA, rotas e regras de autorização. Preferir AWS Systems Manager Session Manager para EC2; manter SSH apenas quando necessário e com origem restrita. Acesso administrativo ao RDS deve ser excepcional e autorizado.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;S3 privado:&lt;/b&gt; Block Public Access ativado; bucket policy e IAM restringem ações, principals e, quando aplicável, o VPC Endpoint. SSE-KMS com permissões mínimas para a chave. O endpoint fornece caminho privado, mas não substitui autorização IAM/bucket policy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Auditoria e monitoramento:&lt;/b&gt; habilitar logs do ALB e WAF, logs da aplicação, métricas e alarmes CloudWatch e CloudTrail para eventos de API/alterações. Definir retenção, acesso restrito e alertas para eventos relevantes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Menor privilégio:&lt;/b&gt; IAM Roles para EC2; sem chaves permanentes no código; segredos no Secrets Manager; políticas IAM/KMS específicas. Restringir entradas e saídas dos Security Groups ao necessário.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rotas:&lt;/b&gt; sub-redes públicas usam IGW; sub-redes privadas não têm rota direta à internet. Adicionar NAT Gateway somente se a aplicação precisar de saída para destinos públicos; preferir VPC Endpoints para serviços AWS compatíveis." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="360" width="1680" x="20" y="830" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="apiA_to_s3_endpoint" edge="1" parent="1" source="apiA" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7AA116;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#7AA116;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;dashed=0;" target="gwe" value="S3 via Gateway Endpoint">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" x="-0.025" as="geometry">
                        <Array as="points">
                            <mxPoint x="598" y="370"/>
                        </Array>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
